omical landmarks, performing needle insertion, and managing the procedure safely. The application provides an interactive learning environment where mistakes can be made without real-world consequences, enabling users to refine their technique and improve decision-making skills.\n\nIdeal for training, revision, or skill reinforcement, this simulation combines visual realism with guided learning to enhance procedural understanding and hands-on readiness in clinical settings.", "short_description": "Master arterial line placement in an immersive VR simulation. Practice accurate catheter insertion, identify anatomical landmarks, and build confidence in a risk-free, interactive environment designed for medical training."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.nbme.org/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MedVR Education", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://medvr.education/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "26059638913645134"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1270439028378240"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1270439028378240"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774520700, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1270439028378240"}]}, "liveChannel